<title>NETHERLANDS: HOLLAND COLOURS FIRST-HALF NET UP 12 PCT.</title>
<headline>HOLLAND COLOURS FIRST-HALF NET UP 12 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.22 vs   2.91</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.7  vs   2.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				45.5  vs  39.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.6  vs   4.7</p>
<p>    Cash flow				4.8  vs   4.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Pigments maker Holland Colours NV said in July its</p>
<p>first quarter order inflow had risen by 10 percent, which</p>
<p>underlined its confidence in the results for the current year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
